  "description": "Extract region-aware, perceptually distinct color palettes from images using image-space segmentation — SLIC superpixels and spatial 5D K-Means — with peak (not averaged) region colors and a saliency-ranked GetColors entry point. Works with local files and URLs. Async-first; dependency-free core (only StbImageSharp, for decoding).",
